{"updateManyByCredentialId(this.credential.id, {}) with empty data could be rejected by Prisma at runtime or become a no-op, so the updatedAt timestamp may not actually change": 0.9245225191116333, "sed -i '' is BSD/macOS-specific and fails on GNU sed (Linux), making the script non-portable for Linux contributors": 0.9524393081665039, "Throwing a plain Error instead of TRPCError will surface as INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR in tRPC rather than preserving NOT_FOUND/FORBIDDEN semantics for clients": 0.9284188747406006, "new Intl.DateTimeFormat(\"en-US\", ...) hard-codes the timestamp formatting locale, causing inconsistent date formatting for non-English users compared to other UI parts that use i18n.language/user locale": 0.8579136729240417, "Handler directly instantiates new CalendarCacheRepository() which bypasses the CalendarCache.init(...) feature-flag logic and its mock when calendar-cache is disabled, causing inconsistent cache status behavior across deployments": 0.9197843670845032, "ENV_FILE=\"../.env\" depends on the caller's current working directory, so running the script from repo root may update the wrong file path": 0.9183735847473145}